<title>JAPAN: C. I. Kasei -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>C. I. Kasei -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.98		vs	   20.48</p>
<p> Operating	  690    million	  vs	  838    million</p>
<p> Current	    853    million	  vs	  912    million</p>
<p> Net		  390    million	  vs	  460    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.68 yen	  vs	   12.57 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     37 million	  vs	  37 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - C. I. Kasei Co Ltd is a leading processor of synthetic resins, primarily PVCs.</p>
